        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<text><p>Paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <u>underline</u>, <strike>strikethrough</strike>, <sub>subscript</sub> and <sup>superscript</sup>. An external <a href=\"https://dasch.swiss\">link</a>, an internal <a class=\"salsah-link\" href=\"http://rdfh.ch/9999/ylMWInTAQxqQcPc51UqwPQ\">resource link</a>, and an <a class=\"internal-link\" href=\"#anchor1\">anchor reference</a>.<footnote content=\"A footnote with &lt;strong&gt;markup&lt;/strong&gt;.\"/></p><h1>Heading 1</h1><h2>Heading 2</h2><h3>Heading 3</h3><h4>Heading 4</h4><h5>Heading 5</h5><h6>Heading 6</h6><ul><li>Unordered item</li></ul><ol><li>Ordered item</li></ol><blockquote>A block quotation</blockquote><cite>A citation</cite><pre>preformatted   text</pre><code>code_sample()</code><table><thead><tr><th>Header cell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Body cell</td></tr></tbody></table><hr/>Text before a break<br/>text after the break.</text>"
      }
    ],
